{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 It is said that in the distant Eastern continent, there is a young man named GUILING who is known for his chivalrous and righteous deeds, as well as his ability to punish and eliminate evil, and is deeply loved by people. One day, evil forces reached out to Dr.Wu's factory, and this evil forces killed the workers and turned the surviving people into cursed zombies. This time, GUILING will set off again to investigate this cursed land. Can he defeat this evil force? Who is the true evil force? Is Dr. Wu the biggest demon? Players will play as the hero GUILING of the mysterious Eastern continent and engage in a life and death battle with demons, searching for ways to break curses, repel zombies, and seal evil spirits. Can we fight against evil forces and escape from the cursed land this time? The wheel of destiny is in your control......The game integrates various gameplay such as decryption, shooting, and physical sandbox, taking you to find the secrets behind the hidden dark world and face up evil spirits much closer! Experience an epic hero journey, feel the fantastic horror and exceptionally interesting gameplay!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614720?t=1771231628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614720?t=1771231628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614720/d5d69ab9040b4371649209c3a239ad88c0e29642/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771231628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614720/d5d69ab9040b4371649209c3a239ad88c0e29642/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771231628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Game Tips</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must Read Before Play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b Starting the game for the first time may take a long time, please be patient and wait</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If there is a crash during game loading or running, please restart and continue the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b During the game, please follow the Task Tip Label on screen to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact customer service: <a href=\"mailto:sicrystalstudio@126.com\">sicrystalstudio@126.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ communication group: 965661157</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 It is said that in the distant Eastern continent, there is a young man named GUILING who is known for his chivalrous and righteous deeds, as well as his ability to punish and eliminate evil, and is deeply loved by people. One day, evil forces reached out to Dr.Wu's factory, and this evil forces killed the workers and turned the surviving people into cursed zombies. This time, GUILING will set off again to investigate this cursed land. Can he defeat this evil force? Who is the true evil force? Is Dr. Wu the biggest demon? Players will play as the hero GUILING of the mysterious Eastern continent and engage in a life and death battle with demons, searching for ways to break curses, repel zombies, and seal evil spirits. Can we fight against evil forces and escape from the cursed land this time? The wheel of destiny is in your control......The game integrates various gameplay such as decryption, shooting, and physical sandbox, taking you to find the secrets behind the hidden dark world and face up evil spirits much closer! Experience an epic hero journey, feel the fantastic horror and exceptionally interesting gameplay!</p>","developers":["\u7845\u6676\u77f3\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4Sicrystal Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"